		<value condition="Control.HasFocus(9512)">Takes the section off the Home stack, with its spotlight and rows; the others move up. Search stays, with the settings and power, so you can always come back here.</value>
		<value condition="Control.HasFocus(9513)">Takes the section off the Home stack, with its spotlight and rows; the others move up. Search stays, with the settings and power, so you can always come back here.</value>
